  "data_abstract": "First measurements of Ds meson elliptic flow (v2) and triangular flow (v3) in PbPb collisions at 5.02 TeV in CMS.\nResults include v2 results in three centrality intervals (0-10%, 10-30%, 30-50%), and v3 in centrality interval 10-30%, both as a function pf pT .\nTables contain central values and associated statistical and systematic uncertainties for each pT bin.\n",
